                                "type": "TextualBody",
                                "format": "text/html",
                                "value": "<p>[fol. 594r]</p><p>Die Dom<em>ini</em>co 17 Martii 1630</p><p></p><p>Fuit facta Congregatio Academia<em>e</em> Pictor<em>um</em> ^Sculptorum^ Indorator<em>um</em> Recamatoru<em>m</em> Urbis<span class=\"line-break\"><br></span>in stantia Solita Ecc<em>le</em>sia<em>e</em> S<em>anc</em>ti Luca<em>e</em> in Campo Boario in qua<span class=\"line-break\"><br></span>intervener<em>un</em>t omnes infra<em>s</em>c<em>rip</em>ti V<em>idelicet</em><span class=\"line-break\"><br></span>Ill D Eques Laurent's Berninus Princeps<span class=\"line-break\"><br></span>Ill DD Augustinus Ciampellus p<em>rimu</em>s Rector<span class=\"line-break\"><br></span>Eques Io'es Lanfranchus<span class=\"line-break\"><br></span>Petrus Fran's de Rubeis Cam<em>era</em>rius<span class=\"line-break\"><br></span>Mich'Angelus Guidi Proveditor<span class=\"line-break\"><br></span>Eques Io'es Baglionus p<em>rimu</em>s Consiliarius<span class=\"line-break\"><br></span>Eques Oct.s Leonus<span class=\"line-break\"><br></span>Io Ant's Carosius<span class=\"line-break\"><br></span>Alovisius Berninius<span class=\"line-break\"><br></span>Io'es Bap'ta Magni<span class=\"line-break\"><br></span>Andreas Bosius<span class=\"line-break\"><br></span>Paulus Baronius<span class=\"line-break\"><br></span>Marchus Tullius Montagna<span class=\"line-break\"><br></span>Ascanius Barisonus<span class=\"line-break\"><br></span>Vincentius Sabaccius<span class=\"line-break\"><br></span>Franc's Maestrinus<span class=\"line-break\"><br></span>Bartholomeus Bombellus<span class=\"line-break\"><br></span>Stefanus Lieri<span class=\"line-break\"><br></span>Christophanus Spinelli<span class=\"line-break\"><br></span>Angelus Bronchonus<span class=\"line-break\"><br></span>Dom.cus Carnaccia<span class=\"line-break\"><br></span>Io Bap'ta Baffoni<span class=\"line-break\"><br></span>Nicolas Bringelli<span class=\"line-break\"><br></span>Franc's Fortunatus<span class=\"line-break\"><br></span>Scipio Quintilius<span class=\"line-break\"><br></span>Cesar Narielli<span class=\"line-break\"><br></span>Io'es Parola<span class=\"line-break\"><br></span>Prosper Ursus<span class=\"line-break\"><br></span>Petrus Franc's Albertus</p>"
